FIELD INTELLIGENCE — SANNIN NETWORK
Source: Jiraiya (Toad Sage), independent spy network
Relayed to: Hokage's Office, Intelligence Division

"Sensei's old student has been busy. The trail on the Akatsuki keeps
leading back to the Hidden Rain — Amegakure. The village is sealed
tight; anyone who goes in asking questions doesn't come back out. Their
leader is called 'Pain,' and the people there speak of him like a god.

I've confirmed the organization moves in two-man cells and is going
after the tailed beasts one by one. That means the kid — Naruto — has
a target on his back. I'm taking him on the road myself to train him;
better he's with me than sitting still.

There's a deeper hand behind all this. Someone is pulling strings from
the shadows. I'll keep digging. Tell Tsunade not to worry — much."

Handling note: Source reliability high. Cross-reference with the
Akatsuki activity log. Network contacts to remain compartmented.
